  "type": "biological",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p>Sylph morphs are ideal for media icons, elite socialites, XP stars, models, and narcissists. Sylph gene sequences are tailored for distinctive good looks, ethereal and elfin features, and slim and lithe bodies. Their metabolism has also been sanitized to eliminate unpleasant bodily odors and their pheromones adjusted for universal appeal.</p>",
    "reference": "Eclipse Phase Second Edition p. 56",
