      "name": "Enhanced Pheromones",
      "type": "physicalTech",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>The morph&rsquo;s biochemistry produces tailored and synthetic pheromonal signals that subconsciously affect the behavior of other biomorphs of the same species. These pheromones influence others that can smell you to treat you warmly and with trust. Apply a +10 modifier to Persuade and Provoke Tests. This augmentation has no effect on non-biomorphs or other species.</p>",
